{
  "cleanupPeriodDays": 3650,
  "skillListingBudgetFraction": 0.02,
  "env": {
    "API_TIMEOUT_MS": "600000",
    "CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL": "claude-sonnet-5",
    "_comment_subagent_model": "Set 2026-08-08. hive-mind-workflows.md has prescribed this line since it was written: 'Keep CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5 so spawned agents do not accidentally inherit expensive Opus/Fable lead sessions.' It was never actually set. Measured consequence: on 2026-08-07 three agents spawned from an opus[1m] lead inherited opus for two literature refreshes and one repo measurement, roughly 357k subagent tokens, all three of which model-selection.md routes to sonnet. Per-call model= on the Agent tool still overrides this for the cases that genuinely need opus, which the routing table names as adversarial verification and judge stages."
  },
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(gh api repos/ShovalBenjer/*)",
      "Bash(gh repo list*)",
      "Bash(gh repo view*)",
      "Bash(gh pr list*)",
      "Bash(gh pr view*)",
      "Bash(gh run list*)",
      "Bash(gh run view*)",
      "Bash(git status*)",
      "Bash(git log*)",
      "Bash(git diff*)",
      "Bash(git show*)",
      "Bash(git rev-parse*)",
      "Bash(git ls-files*)",
      "Bash(git add*)",
      "Bash(git commit*)",
      "Bash(python*)",
      "Bash(uv run*)",
      "Bash(uv sync*)",
      "WebFetch",
      "WebSearch",
      "Bash(git push*)",
      "Bash(git rebase*)",
      "Bash(git branch*)",
      "Bash(git stash*)",
      "Bash(git worktree*)",
      "Bash(git fetch*)",
      "Bash(git checkout*)",
      "Bash(git merge*)",
      "Bash(gh pr*)",
      "Bash(gh run*)",
      "Bash",
      "Edit(~/.claude/hooks/**)",
      "Edit(~/.claude/settings.json)",
      "Edit(~/.claude/skills/**)",
      "Edit(~/.claude/rules/**)",
      "Edit(~/.claude/agents/**)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(rm -rf /*)",
      "Bash(rm -rf $HOME*)",
      "Bash(rm -rf ~/*)",
      "Bash(rm -rf .git*)",
      "Bash(git reset --hard*)",
      "Bash(git clean -f*)",
      "Bash(git branch -D *)",
      "Bash(curl * | sh)",
      "Bash(curl * | bash)",
      "Bash(wget * | sh)",
      "Bash(wget * | bash)",
      "Edit(.env)",
      "Edit(.env.local)",
      "Edit(.env.*.local)",
      "Edit(.env.production)",
      "Edit(.env.staging)",
      "Edit(.env.development)",
      "Edit(.env.test)",
      "Edit(**/.ssh/**)",
      "Edit(~/.ssh/**)",
      "Edit(~/.claude/.credentials.json)",
      "Edit(~/.aws/credentials)",
      "Edit(~/.config/gh/hosts.yml)",
      "Edit(~/.azure/**)",
      "Edit(~/.config/gcloud/**)",
      "Edit(**/credentials.json)",
      "Edit(**/credentials.yaml)",
      "Edit(**/credentials.yml)",
      "Edit(**/service-account*.json)",
      "Edit(**/*.pem)",
      "Edit(**/*.key)",
      "Read(.env)",
      "Read(.env.local)",
      "Read(.env.*.local)",
      "Read(.env.production)",
      "Read(.env.staging)",
      "Read(.env.development)",
      "Read(.env.test)",
      "Read(**/.ssh/**)",
      "Read(~/.ssh/**)",
      "Read(~/.claude/.credentials.json)",
      "Read(~/.aws/credentials)",
      "Read(~/.config/gh/hosts.yml)",
      "Read(~/.azure/**)",
      "Read(~/.config/gcloud/**)",
      "Read(**/credentials.json)",
      "Read(**/credentials.yaml)",
      "Read(**/credentials.yml)",
      "Read(**/service-account*.json)",
      "Read(**/*.pem)",
      "Read(**/*.key)"
    ],
    "defaultMode": "bypassPermissions",
    "_comment_allow": [
      "Read-only and self-owned operations pre-approved so NON-INTERACTIVE runs can",
      "work. On 2026-07-26 three scheduled learning-platform sessions died identically:",
      "gh, WebFetch, WebSearch, python and git all returned 'requires approval' and the",
      "sessions reported 'this session is non-interactive, so approval cannot be",
      "obtained'. The council run, the corpus diff and the critic post never executed.",
      "53 deny rules with zero allow rules is correct for interactive work and fatal for",
      "automation, where ask means die. Every entry below is either read-only, or a",
      "write confined to this operator's own repositories. Nothing here weakens a deny",
      "rule: deny is evaluated first and still wins.",
      "",
      "2026-08-07, operator instruction: 'change settings so change hooks is allowed, and",
      "not needed my bash approval. I want autonomus.' Two separate gaps were open. The",
      "allow list enumerated individual git and gh subcommands, so any bash outside those",
      "30 patterns fell through to a prompt even though defaultMode is bypassPermissions;",
      "bare Bash now covers the tool. And the live tree under ~/.claude had no Edit or",
      "Write entry at all, so touching a hook, skill, rule or agent asked every time,",
      "which is the surface this operator most often changes.",
      "",
      "This does NOT weaken the deny list, which is evaluated first and still wins, and it",
      "does not touch the PreToolUse hookgate binary, which independently blocks recursive",
      "deletion, hard resets, forced clean, bare force-push, remote ref deletion, checkout",
      "and restore forms that discard a worktree, curl-piped-to-shell, and reads of likely",
      "credential files. Credential paths stay denied for both Read and Edit. The autonomy",
      "granted here is breadth of ordinary commands, not permission to run dangerous ones."
    ]
  },
  "model": "claude-fable-5[1m]",
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash",
            "args": [
              "/home/shov/.claude/hooks/session-recall.sh"
            ],
            "timeout": 10
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3",
            "args": [
              "/home/shov/claude-setup/tools/bus/bus.py",
              "inbox"
            ],
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/home/shov/claude-setup/tools/hookgate/target/release/hookgate",
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3",
            "args": [
              "/home/shov/.claude/hooks/pre_push_gate.py"
            ],
            "timeout": 90
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Skill",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash",
            "args": [
              "/home/shov/.claude/hooks/skill-usage-log.sh"
            ],
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Agent",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3",
            "args": [
              "/home/shov/claude-setup/tools/intent/spawn_log.py"
            ],
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreCompact": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash",
            "args": [
              "/home/shov/.claude/hooks/precompact-handoff.sh"
            ],
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3",
            "args": [
              "/home/shov/.claude/hooks/completion_gate.py"
            ],
            "timeout": 8
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3",
            "args": [
              "/home/shov/.claude/hooks/ship_gate_stop.py"
            ],
            "timeout": 20
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3",
            "args": [
              "/home/shov/.claude/hooks/prior_art_gate.py"
            ],
            "timeout": 8
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Notification": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "powershell.exe",
            "args": [
              "-NoProfile",
              "-ExecutionPolicy",
              "Bypass",
              "-File",
              "/home/shov/.claude/hooks/notify-toast.ps1"
            ],
            "timeout": 15,
            "statusMessage": "Raising Windows toast",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3",
            "args": [
              "/home/shov/claude-setup/tools/intent/capture_turn.py"
            ],
            "timeout": 10
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3",
            "args": [
              "/home/shov/claude-setup/tools/bus/bus.py",
              "inbox"
            ],
            "timeout": 10
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3",
            "args": [
              "/home/shov/.claude/hooks/route.py"
            ],
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "worktree": {
    "baseRef": "head"
  },
  "workflowKeywordTriggerEnabled": true,
  "outputStyle": "shoval",
  "alwaysThinkingEnabled": false,
  "effortLevel": "low",
  "advisorModel": "opus",
  "promptSuggestionEnabled": false,
  "awaySummaryEnabled": false,
  "askUserQuestionTimeout": "60s",
  "autoUpdatesChannel": "latest",
  "skipDangerousModePermissionPrompt": true,
  "theme": "dark",
  "editorMode": "normal",
  "verbose": false,
  "autoCompactEnabled": true,
  "switchModelsOnFlag": false,
  "remoteControlAtStartup": false,
  "inputNeededNotifEnabled": false,
  "agentPushNotifEnabled": false,
  "useAutoModeDuringPlan": false
}
